; Native kernel boundary for AOT linking (workstream K).
; Required ONLY by BEAM-side drivers (native.chunks). It is deliberately not in
; the 18-namespace compiler closure: native.scheme / native.eval must not
; require it (update-closure refuses added dependencies).
;
; Contract (fixed before fan-out; see research/native-seed/speed/CONTRACT.md):
;   (remote-template node) -> nil | (fn [operands] scheme-expression-string)
;     node is an ANF :remote node; operands is a vector of Scheme variable
;     names ALREADY bound to the evaluated arguments in source order.
;     The expression must have exactly the semantics of the registered leaf
;     or compiled target for that module/function/arity on the native value
;     representation, including raised errors.
;   (kernel-override ns name) -> nil | scheme-expression-string
;     A native host implementation that REPLACES the compiled definition's
;     value for ns/name (e.g. rt/k-eqv). Must be observationally identical to
;     the BL definition in priv/boot/rt.bl for every native value.
(ns native.intrinsics)

(defn remote-template [node] nil)
(defn kernel-override [ns name] nil)
